            "text": "12 post sts × 10 rows = 10 × 10 cm in chunky cotton with a 6 mm hook. The basket weave pattern pulls in slightly: check width after the first two pattern rows."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stitches used"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Chain (ch)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Treble (tr). UK term; US equivalent is double crochet (dc)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Front post treble (fptr): yarn over, insert hook from front to back to front around the post of the stitch 2 rows below, draw up a loop, complete as tr."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Back post treble (bptr): yarn over, insert hook from back to front to back around the post of the stitch 2 rows below, draw up a loop, complete as tr."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pattern repeat is 4 sts wide. Foundation: ch 51."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Row 1 (base row): ch 3 (counts as tr), tr in each ch across (48 tr). Turn."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Row 2 (basket pattern): ch 3 (counts as tr), *fptr around each of next 4 sts, bptr around each of next 4 sts; repeat from * across (48 sts). Turn."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Row 3: same as row 2: continue the same fptr/bptr columns as the previous row (48 sts). Turn."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Row 4 (switch): ch 3, *bptr around each of next 4 sts, fptr around each of next 4 sts; repeat from * across (48 sts). Turn. This swaps the raised and recessed columns."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Row 5: same as row 4 (48 sts). Turn."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Repeat rows 2, 5 until mat measures 60 cm (approx. 60 rows). Fasten off."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weave in both ends. The basket weave fabric is naturally dense and lies flat without blocking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Care"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Machine-wash on 30°C gentle cycle. Lay flat to dry. The cotton softens with use."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
